{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "aa8qkxggxocw50x8", "title": "Java会因容器技术盛行而没落吗", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"EtLt9\" id=\"EtLt9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u29cc92e3\" id=\"u29cc92e3\">背景：</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u4f4f739c\" id=\"u4f4f739c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub08fabb9\" id=\"ub08fabb9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 77, 77)\">近年来以容器为核心的云原生技术，让服务端部署的伸缩性、可协作性，得到巨大的提升。使得原本开发语言本身选取的重要性，有一定程度的减弱。但不妨碍Java语言本身继续保持活力。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u197f6c07\" id=\"u197f6c07\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4b744214\" id=\"u4b744214\">容器的出现，改变了代码的运行模式，促进了</span><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/search?q=%E4%BA%91%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F&amp;search_source=Entity&amp;hybrid_search_source=Entity&amp;hybrid_search_extra=%7B%22sourceType%22%3A%22answer%22%2C%22sourceId%22%3A2738569054%7D\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ufc2414cc\" id=\"ufc2414cc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7bd33390\" id=\"u7bd33390\">云原生</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u7019a7f7\" id=\"u7019a7f7\">的发展。与语言无关。容器具有以下优势。</span></p><ul list=\"u2c1d2566\"><li fid=\"u254f4ce4\" data-lake-id=\"uf16fb250\" id=\"uf16fb250\"><span data-lake-id=\"u328b8e81\" id=\"u328b8e81\">降低开销<br />容器采用一个应用一个进程的模式在操作系统上运行。容器采用的LXC实现隔离。cgroups实现资源分配，底层本质上还是有同一套操作系统。与传统或硬件虚拟机环境相比，容器所需的系统资源更少，因为它们不包含操作系统映像。</span></li><li fid=\"u254f4ce4\" data-lake-id=\"u8cea7383\" id=\"u8cea7383\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5693631b\" id=\"u5693631b\">标准化，可移植<br />只要符合开放容器标准（OCI）的应用就可以通过容器运行。</span></li><li fid=\"u254f4ce4\" data-lake-id=\"u8d79ea81\" id=\"u8d79ea81\"><span data-lake-id=\"u64061b06\" id=\"u64061b06\">便捷的环境管理<br />容器提供了一系列的API操作，可以对容器的资源分配，部署运行等进行管理。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u734a6f51\" id=\"u734a6f51\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc0928fbe\" id=\"uc0928fbe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u43414f61\" id=\"u43414f61\">诚然容器的出现，通过制定一套标准的方式来实现了跨平台,且不少大厂也有项目go取代java。但Java还有其他不可忽视的优势。跨平台只是Java语言里面应用并不广泛的特性，所以不会因为容器技术盛行而没落。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u420b20a2\" id=\"u420b20a2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uca6332e2\" id=\"uca6332e2\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"mcYVc\" id=\"mcYVc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9cc36e21\" id=\"u9cc36e21\">跨平台</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u829ff7ad\" id=\"u829ff7ad\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u87c0e581\" id=\"u87c0e581\">实际上，在后端并没有太多的应用场景需要 Java 跨平台，大多数的 Java 后端服务都运行在 x64 Linux 环境上。真正需要关注跨平台的是客户端编程，但这个领域中 Java 的份额相对较小，而且也不会经常用到 Docker。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8c1351f6\" id=\"u8c1351f6\"><span data-lake-id=\"uebaa564e\" id=\"uebaa564e\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6951521a\" id=\"u6951521a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc3681a0c\" id=\"uc3681a0c\">Docker 和 Kubernetes（k8s）的兴起实际上更多是为了方便管理和部署，Docker 只是在 Linux 核心之上添加了一层薄薄的映射，它主要省去的是配置环境的时间，而不是减少代码在运行时跨平台的问题。Docker 并不是专门用来处理跨平台问题的工具，它更多是用来解决环境依赖的问题。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u932bf6d5\" id=\"u932bf6d5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u71762f1b\" id=\"u71762f1b\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7ee97d6a\" id=\"u7ee97d6a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2f6c7e94\" id=\"u2f6c7e94\">而 Kubernetes 则更侧重于集群资源管理，这对于所有支持微服务的语言都是有益的，当然也包括 Java。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"a081d687\" id=\"a081d687\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1ca5a2f1\" id=\"u1ca5a2f1\" style=\"color: rgb(25, 27, 31)\">性能方面</span></h2><ul list=\"u21c32bec\"><li fid=\"u96bc3440\" data-lake-id=\"uc6db6158\" id=\"uc6db6158\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8cf2d320\" id=\"u8cf2d320\" style=\"color: rgb(25, 27, 31)\">运行性能</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"uba9116f2\" id=\"uba9116f2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0c84eabe\" id=\"u0c84eabe\" style=\"color: rgb(25, 27, 31)\">The Benchmarks Game选择了目前热门的25种语言做了</span><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//goodmanwen.github.io/Programming-Language-Benchmarks-Visualization\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u6f3a71d5\" id=\"u6f3a71d5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue3026352\" id=\"ue3026352\" style=\"color: rgb(25, 27, 31)\">性能测试</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ue330263f\" id=\"ue330263f\" style=\"color: rgb(25, 27, 31)\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5a612258\" id=\"u5a612258\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F43518495%2F1723034951407-f21698ec-8daf-4db4-92a1-8b71e67125ee.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u36760577-0591-4d50-bb08-6bd928b0293%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ucc2bf6be-285d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A741.818165739706%2C%22height%22%3A810%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A100082%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A816%2C%22originHeight%22%3A891%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.100000023841858%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22HECOMPUTERLANQUAGEBENCHMARKSGAMEVISUALIZATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A153%2C%22y%22%3A8%2C%22width%22%3A471%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MPTION(MULTIPLIER)RANKING(WEIGHTEDBYTIME%22%2C%22x%22%3A254%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A272%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22R3TIMECONSUNMPTION(MULTIPLIER)3.%22%2C%22x%22%3A133%2C%22y%22%3A412%2C%22width%22%3A190%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UPDATEDATE%3A2023-02-01%22%2C%22x%22%3A667%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CLASSICFORTRAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A1%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HASKELLGHC%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A383%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ADA2012GNAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1%2C%22y%22%3A286%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FREEPASCAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A25%2C%22y%22%3A416%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OCAML%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A481%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WSMALLTALK%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A841%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PYTHON3%